{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a futuristic hologrid battlefield, waves of biomechanical invaders march toward their objective. To secure victory, you must strategically deploy an arsenal of next-gen defense modules \u2013 from plasma turrets to quantum disruptors \u2013 each engineered to counter specific enemy patterns.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every weapon system has unique traits: attack speed, effective range, elemental attributes, and energy consumption. Master their synergies to pinpoint enemy vulnerabilities, then orchestrate overwhelming firepower through tactical combos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 25+ cinematic abilities like singularity generators and chrono-freeze fields, but remember: advanced warfare demands resource management. Balance your upgrades wisely as every credit spent impacts your endgame loadout.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985010?t=1757491169","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985010?t=1757491169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985010/7ca2e02c76285464b262c9ab8601c3a1ecf6d3f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757491169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985010/7ca2e02c76285464b262c9ab8601c3a1ecf6d3f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757491169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a futuristic hologrid battlefield, waves of biomechanical invaders march toward their objective. To secure victory, you must strategically deploy an arsenal of next-gen defense modules \u2013 from plasma turrets to quantum disruptors \u2013 each engineered to counter specific enemy patterns.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph